## PR / agent checklist

### Any new Editor UITK surface

- [ ] New Editor UI uses UITK, not IMGUI, unless documented exception
- [ ] Editor styles live under `Assets/UI/Editor/` with BEM classes matching C# toggles

### Custom SO inspector (`CreateInspectorGUI`)

- [ ] `[CustomEditor(typeof(...))]` + `CreateInspectorGUI` — not `OnInspectorGUI` for new work
- [ ] Root block BEM class + USS under `Assets/UI/Editor/<Feature>/`
- [ ] Content-id dropdowns use **catalog helpers** + **`EditorContentDatabaseField`** at top when roster comes from ContentDatabase
- [ ] List/picker panels implement **`RefreshCatalogSources()`** wired to scope field callback
- [ ] Collapsible bordered rows: **`editor-foldout-card`** on `Foldout` root + load **`EditorFoldoutCard.uss`** (not wrapper `VisualElement`)
- [ ] `root.Bind(serializedObject)` after building tree

## Content database scope (catalog pickers)

Editor catalog dropdowns (`EnemyDefinitionCatalog`, `StoryEventDefinitionCatalog`, Floor Editor choices) read the active database via **`EditorContentDatabaseScope.Resolve()`** — not hardcoded paths in each tool.

| Piece | Role |
|-------|------|
| `EditorContentDatabaseScope` | EditorPrefs GUID persistence + fallback to `DevSceneComposition.ContentPath` |
| `EditorContentDatabaseField` | Reusable UITK `ObjectField` that writes scope + raises refresh callback |
| Catalog APIs | Optional `ContentDatabase? database = null`; default resolves scope |

**Rules**

- Do **not** add new `AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<ContentDatabase>(hardcodedPath)` in editor pickers — call scope or accept an injected `ContentDatabase`.
- Tools with catalog pickers expose **`EditorContentDatabaseField`** (or call scope) and **refresh** child inspectors when it changes.
- Floor Editor and Encounter Group editor share the **same** EditorPrefs key — one pick applies project-wide in the Editor session.

Reference: `EditorContentDatabaseScope.cs`, `EncounterGroupEditor.cs`, `FloorEditorContentDatabaseBar.cs`.
